==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 30,000 and increases by 30,000 with each stage.
*13 of [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds, delay between them is 12~14 seconds.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay between them is 21.33~23.33 seconds<sup>640f~700f</sup>.
*Unlimited [[Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay between them is 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP, [[Le'Grim]] spawns with:
**10 Jackie Pengs, delay 18.67~21.33 seconds<sup>560f~640f</sup>
**3 Teacher Bears, delay 33.33~36.7 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>

